OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FTonight,
OL,6,Fshowers, frequent for some, will
OL,7,Fcontinue to feed in and some of these
OL,8,Fmay be heavy. It will also stay windy,
OL,9,Fespecially along the coasts and within
OL,10,Fthe showers. Feeling cooler than last
OL,11,Fnight, particularly in the north.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA blustery and cold feeling
OL,14,Fday with further showers, frequent and
OL,15,Fheavy for some, with occasional sunny
OL,16,Fspells. Showers and winds will ease
OL,17,Fthrough the evening, bringing a
OL,18,Fsettled night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
