OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA
OL,6,Fcalmer end to the weekend with some
OL,7,Fsunny spells on Sunday. On Monday,
OL,8,Fcloud and drizzle but feeling milder,
OL,9,Fthen sunnier with strong winds on
OL,10,FTuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
